WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.750
Red Bull.

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.168
It made this guy a

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.628
$15 billion fortune.

00:00:03.628 --> 00:00:05.839
But the recipe for his
success wasn't just

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:06.381
sugar,

00:00:06.381 --> 00:00:07.674
carbonated water,

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:08.258
caffeine and

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:10.218
whatever that is.

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:12.137
There was another
major innovation.

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:13.346
Dietrich Mateschitz was

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:14.639
Austria's richest man

00:00:14.639 --> 00:00:15.724
when he died in October,

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:16.933
and he and his team

00:00:16.933 --> 00:00:19.019
managed to turn Red Bull
into so much more

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:21.021
than just an energy drink.

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:22.939
One of the very clever
things they've done is

00:00:22.939 --> 00:00:24.858
turn Red Bull into a story brand.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:25.817
They tell stories.

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:29.195
And so one of the things they did
was a light on events,

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:31.573
and in particular extreme sports,

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:34.034
things like cliff diving
or mountain biking.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:36.244
These weren't terribly
expensive to back

00:00:36.244 --> 00:00:38.329
because they were
comparatively little known.

00:00:38.329 --> 00:00:40.206
And yet Red Bull has
made them big

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.541
and produced a lot of content

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:44.544
that they can then further
promote the brand with.

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:48.089
Whether snowboarders,
space jumps or, more recently,

00:00:48.089 --> 00:00:51.009
owning soccer and
Formula 1 racing teams,

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:53.303
Red Bull has spread its
marketing tentacles

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:55.930
more deeply into sport than
any brand before.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:58.099
And Mateschitz got lucky
because the approach

00:00:58.099 --> 00:01:00.310
coincided with the rise
of social media

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:01.644
and digital video.

00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:04.189
Rather than paying
for newspaper or TV ads,

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:06.316
videos of extreme
sports could go viral

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:07.901
at little to no extra cost,

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:10.153
and his brand was
splashed all over it.

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:12.405
That's what really gave
Red Bull wings.

